DOCUMENT();
loadMacros(
"PGstandard.pl",
"MathObjects.pl",
"PGML.pl"
);
Context("Interval");

$set_ans_10 = Compute("((({-10, 5, 9} - ((-infinity, infinity) - (-infinity, 14])))) U (-infinity, 14] U ((-infinity, 14]) - ((-infinity, infinity) - {-8, 6})");
$set_ans_11 = Compute("{-10, 5, 9} - ((-infinity, infinity) - ({-8, 6})) U {-10, 5, 9} U {-10, 5, 9}");
$set_ans_12 = Compute("{-8, 6} U {-10, 5, 9} U {-10, 5, 9} - ((-infinity, infinity) - (-infinity, 14])");
$set_ans_8 = Compute("{3, 6, 10} U {3, 6, 10} U ({3, 6, 10})");
$set_ans_9 = Compute("{6, 7} U {3, 6, 10} U {-8, -6, -5, 0, 5} U {6, 7}");
$set_ans_6 = Compute("{-8, -1, 1, 6, 9, 10} U (-infinity, 17) U {-8, -1, 1, 6, 9, 10} U (-infinity, 16]");
$set_ans_7 = Compute("(-infinity, 16] - ((-infinity, infinity) - {-8, -1, 1, 6, 9, 10}) - ((-infinity, infinity) - (-infinity, 16])");
$set_ans_4 = Compute("([1, 14] - ([1, 14]))");
$set_ans_5 = Compute("[1, 14] U (-infinity, 13]");
$set_ans_1 = Compute("{-10, -7, -5, 3, 4, 8} - ((-infinity, infinity) - ((-infinity, 12))) U (-infinity, 12)");
$set_ans_2 = Compute("(-infinity, 12] U (-infinity, 12] U (-infinity, 12) U ((-infinity, 12) - ((-infinity, infinity) - ({-10, -7, -5, 3, 4, 8} U ((-infinity, 12)))))");
$set_ans_3 = Compute("((((-infinity, 12] U {-10, -7, -5, 3, 4, 8} U (-infinity, 12))) U (-infinity, 12] U (-infinity, 12) - ((-infinity, infinity) - (-infinity, 12))) U (-infinity, 12) U {-10, -7, -5, 3, 4, 8}");

BEGIN_PGML
# Questions:

_For arithmetic problems, if the result is not an integer, then retain *three significant digits*._

Given the sets:
- [`A = \{-10, -7, -5, 3, 4, 8\}`]
- [`B = \{x | x \leq 12\}`]
- [`C = \{x | x < 12\}`]

Compute:
- [`A \cap (C) \cup C = `] [_____]{$set_ans_1}
- [`B \cup B \cup C \cup (C \cap (A \cup (C))) = `] [_____]{$set_ans_2}
- [`(((B \cup A \cup C)) \cup B \cup C \cap C) \cup C \cup A = `] [_____]{$set_ans_3}

---

Given the sets:
- [`A = \{x | x \leq 13\}`]
- [`B = \{x | 1 \leq x \leq 14\}`]

Compute:
- [`B - (B) = `] [_____]{$set_ans_4}
- [`B \cup A = `] [_____]{$set_ans_5}

---

Given the sets:
- [`A = \{x | x < 17\}`]
- [`B = \{x | x \leq 16\}`]
- [`C = \{-8, -1, 1, 6, 9, 10\}`]

Compute:
- [`C \cup A \cup C \cup B = `] [_____]{$set_ans_6}
- [`B \cap C \cap B = `] [_____]{$set_ans_7}

---

Given the sets:
- [`A = \{3, 6, 10\}`]
- [`B = \{-8, -6, -5, 0, 5\}`]
- [`C = \{6, 7\}`]

Compute:
- [`A \cup A \cup (A) = `] [_____]{$set_ans_8}
- [`C \cup A \cup B \cup C = `] [_____]{$set_ans_9}

---

Given the sets:
- [`A = \{x | x \leq 14\}`]
- [`B = \{-10, 5, 9\}`]
- [`C = \{-8, 6\}`]

Compute:
- [`(((B \cap A))) \cup A \cup (A) \cap C = `] [_____]{$set_ans_10}
- [`B \cap (C) \cup B \cup B = `] [_____]{$set_ans_11}
- [`C \cup B \cup B \cap A = `] [_____]{$set_ans_12}

---
END_PGML
ENDDOCUMENT();
